From 85d9151641b5f2f8b5b348e54e13ad6ee041d6f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Franz-Josef Haider <frajo@frajo.fi>
Date: Mon, 29 Dec 2025 15:14:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] lepton: Fake uid implementation.

This implements a fake uid, which is used by android to determine for example
which app is doing what. We only run one app per container so we run everything
as the same user and with using the linux uids/gids this would result in android
getting very confused. We need to be able to pass the uids/gids between execve
invocations, therefore the environment variables.

Change-Id: Ie9121f046ad5f3744aa85581122a59ba63072b1d
